169 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 97 0 R/E(It gives us immense pleasure to present INNOVISION 2026, the annual magazine of the Computer Society of India \(CSI\) Student Chapter, Department of Information Technology, St. Vincent Pallotti College of Engineering & Technology, Nagpur The word Innovision reflects the spirit of innovation guided by vision \204 the ability to think beyond boundaries, explore new possibilities, and transform ideas into meaningful outcomes. In a world where technology continues to evolve, this magazine serves as a platform to celebrate not only technical knowledge but also creativity, curiosity, collaboration, and the diverse talents of our students.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

170 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 97 0 R/E(INNOVISION brings together the vibrant experiences and accomplishments of our department through technical events, student achievements, competitions, research contributions, faculty messages, and departmental activities. Each page captures a part of our journey as learners and innovators, highlighting the enthusiasm, dedication, and collective efforts that shape our academic community Beyond documenting events and achievements, this magazine aims to inspire young minds to question, explore, create, and share their perspectives. We believe that learning extends beyond classrooms and laboratories; it grows through the exchange of ideas, teamwork, experimentation, and the courage to embrace new challenges. Through INNOVISION, we hope to encourage every student to discover their potential and contribute to the ever-evolving world of technology.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

171 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 97 0 R/E(We express our sincere gratitude to our respected Head of the Department, faculty coordinators, and the CSI Student Chapter for their invaluable guidance, encouragement, and support. We also extend our appreciation to the editorial team and all contributors whose efforts, ideas, and commitment have helped bring this edition to life.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

172 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 97 0 R/E(As we turn these pages, may we continue to think creatively, innovate fearlessly, and envision possibilities beyond the code. May INNOVISION stand as a reflection of our shared aspirations and a reminder that every great innovation begins with an idea and the vision to pursue it.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

