253 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 101 0 R/E(\215The CSI Forum at SVPCET reflects our commitment to nurturing a community of learners who are future-ready. It provides our students with the opportunity to engage with technology in a constructive and meaningful way, while also instilling values of discipline and teamwork. What excites me most about this initiative is that it brings together students, faculty, and professionals under one umbrella, creating a vibrant ecosystem where ideas can grow into impactful innovations. Such platforms shape not only competent engineers but also responsible contributors to society.\216)/Pg 15 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

254 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 101 0 R/E(FR. DR. PAUL CHANDRANKUNNEL)/Pg 15 0 R/K[2]>>
