<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 102 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/A[1231 0 R 0]/K[4]>>
endobj

268 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 102 0 R/T(I believe the CSI Forum should be a platform for technical learning, innovation, and student development. It should encourage students to explore emerging technologies, develop practical skills, and enhance their leadership and teamwork abilities. My expectation is that the forum will create meaningful learning opportunities and contribute to the professional growth of students and the technical reputation of our college.)/E(I believe the CSI Forum should be a platform for technical learning, innovation, and student development. It should encourage students to explore emerging technologies, develop practical skills, and enhance their leadership and teamwork abilities. My expectation is that the forum will create meaningful learning opportunities and contribute to the professional growth of students and the technical reputation of our college.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

