580 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 116 0 R/E(The CSI Student Chapter of the Department of Information Technology at St. Vincent Pallotti College of Engineering & Technology successfully conducted an online webinar titled \215Artificial Intelligence: Your Secret to Job Success\216 on 28th September 2025. The webinar aimed to introduce students to Artificial Intelligence \(AI\), its expanding role in the professional world, and the skills needed to succeed in an increasingly technology-driven job market.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

581 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 116 0 R/E(The webinar highlighted industry-relevant skills, essential AI tools, emerging career opportunities, and effective interview preparation strategies. It encouraged students to strengthen their practical knowledge, improve their confidence, and adapt to the evolving requirements of the technology sector. The session was intended for an audience of more than 80 students.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

582 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 116 0 R/E(The session was led by Mr. Aditya Jain, an AI expert, IIT Bombay alumnus, and former Amazon Data Scientist. He shared his industry experience and insights into AI concepts, practical tools, and real-world applications. He also discussed how AI is reshaping professional careers and how students can use their knowledge of AI to prepare for competitive job interviews.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

583 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 116 0 R/E(The webinar provided an engaging learning experience, helping participants understand current industry expectations and the importance of continuous learning for career growth. Through this initiative, the CSI Student Chapter reaffirmed its commitment to technical education, industry awareness, and professional development, motivating students to explore emerging technologies and prepare for future career opportunities.)/Pg 30 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

