<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 117 0 R/T(The Department of Information Technology at St. Vincent Pallotti College of Engineering and Technology, under the CSI Student Chapter, successfully organized an Expert Talk on Research Paper Writing on 1st October 2025, from 2:15 PM to 4:15 PM. The session was delivered by Prof. Jagdish Pimple and coordinated by student coordinators Mr. Shantanu Mangalkar and Ms. Sejal Nimkar. A total of 77 CSI student members participated, comprising 45 students from Semester V and 32 from Semester VII.)/E(The Department of Information Technology at St. Vincent Pallotti College of Engineering and Technology, under the CSI Student Chapter, successfully organized an Expert Talk on Research Paper Writing on 1st October 2025, from 2:15 PM to 4:15 PM. The session was delivered by Prof. Jagdish Pimple and coordinated by student coordinators Mr. Shantanu Mangalkar and Ms. Sejal Nimkar. A total of 77 CSI student members participated, comprising 45 students from Semester V and 32 from Semester VII.)/Pg 31 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

