825 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(DEVELOPMENT OF A MULTI-CATEGORY DIGITAL           DONATION PLATFORM )/Pg 44 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

826 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 130 0 R/E(Abstract - The donation process often faces challenges due to the lack of a centralized and trustworthy platform connecting donors with non-governmental organizations \(NGOs\). Donors frequently struggle to identify genuine organizations and understand their current requirements, while NGOs lack an efficient way to publicly communicate their needs. To address this issue, this project proposes a web-based donation management platform that facilitates direct interaction between donors and verified NGOs. The platform enables NGOs to list real-time requirements such as clothes, food, books, medicines, essential goods, and monetary donations. Donors can browse requests, locate nearby NGOs through an interactive map, contribute to causes of their choice, and track donation status. An administrative verification system ensures that only authenticated NGOs are registered on the platform, enhancing transparency and trust. The system is developed using HTML, CSS, Tailwind CSS, JavaScript, Leaflet.js, and a Node.js or Django backend with database support. By providing a structured and user-friendly environment for donations, the platform aims to simplify the donation process, improve resource distribution, and strengthen collaboration between donors and NGOs.)/Pg 44 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

