<</Title(\215The CSI Forum has brought a new energy to the IT Department by encouraging students to explore advanced areas of computing such as machine learning, data analytics, and cloud technologies. It pushes them to question existing methods and come up with novel solutions. I particularly value how the forum emphasizes peer-to-peer learning and collaboration, where students share knowledge and grow together. This culture of curiosity and exploration is essential for building innovative technologists who can adapt to the evolving digital landscape.\216)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 992 0 R/Prev 1872 0 R>>
