<</Title(The expert talk encouraged students to develop a research-oriented mindset and strengthened their understanding of academic writing and publication practices. It motivated them to explore innovative research opportunities, present original ideas, and contribute to academic knowledge through quality publications. Overall, the session enhanced students' confidence and established a foundation for future research endeavours, reinforcing the CSI Student Chapter's commitment to academic excellence and professional development.)/Dest[31 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2840 0 R/Prev 2863 0 R/Next 2849 0 R>>
