2868 0 obj
<</Title(The CSI Student Chapter, under the Department of Information Technology at St. Vincent Pallotti College of Engineering & Technology, organized \215Innovision Dialogue\216 on 7th August 2025. Tailored specifically for third-semester IT students, the initiative was conceived to introduce budding engineers to structured group ideation, articulate discourse, and creative problem-solving. Spearheaded under the mentorship of faculty coordinator Prof. Jagdish Pimple alongside student coordinators Mr. Vedant Joshi, Ms. Anushka Pannase, and Ms. Aditi Dhawad, the forum created an interactive ecosystem where students could step forward, exchange perspectives, and cultivate confidence in public speaking.)/Dest[28 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2860 0 R/Next 2875 0 R>>
endobj

