2875 0 obj
<</Title(Moving away from conventional lecture settings, the event adopted an open discussion model that encouraged attendees to critically examine pressing real-world challenges. Participants tackled topics directly impacting student life and society - including academic stress management, digital well-being, environmental consciousness, and campus infrastructure enhancement.)/Dest[28 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2860 0 R/Prev 2868 0 R/Next 2881 0 R>>
endobj

2876 0 obj
<</Title(communicate technical and non-technical ideas with clarity. Innovision Dialogue served as a catalyst for peer-to-peer learning and active teamwork. By bridging classroom concepts with practical societal applications, the session empowered participants to think critically, respect diverse viewpoints, and embrace innovation as a tool for everyday impact. The program concluded on a resonant note, underscoring the CSI Student Chapter\220s ongoing commitment to providing experiential platforms that nurture leadership, intellectual curiosity, and collaborative growth.)/Dest[28 0 R/Fit]/Parent 2860 0 R/Prev 2881 0 R/Next 2869 0 R>>
endobj

